        <item>
            <title>2.12.15</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:58:11 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/hoomanaskari/mac-dictate-anywhere</link>
            <sparkle:version>57</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.12.15</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.15

- Choose speech models more easily with clearer model names, supported languages, and streaming presets.
- Reduce first-use delays by sharing model preparation and preparing speech and cleanup models together when possible.
- Release inactive model resources while keeping selected models ready for dictation.
- Prepare the next Apple Speech session while idle.
- Improve reliability when switching models or cancelling dictation, including cancellation during remote cleanup preparation.
- Fix manual vocabulary preparation when the speech model has not loaded yet.
]]></description>
